{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-03-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'DEWALT POWERSTACK™ BATTERIES MORE THAN STACK UP FOR CONSTRUCTION AND TRADE PROFESSIONALS', 'text': "TOWSON, MD., MARCH 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DEWALT, A STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) BRAND AND INDUSTRY LEADER IN TOTAL JOBSITE SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE DEWALT POWERSTACK™ 20V MAX* COMPACT BATTERY, THE WORLD'S FIRST POUCH CELL BATTERY DESIGNED FOR THE CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY, HAS BEEN MET WITH RAVE REVIEWS FROM CONSTRUCTION AND TRADE PROFESSIONALS FOR ITS TECHNOLOGICAL BREAKTHROUGH."}